{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn2le05ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Conversation 1</span>", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Salut Pierre. Qu'est-ce que tu fais le week-end prochain ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Coraline et moi allons \u00e0 la plage du Temps \u00e0 Montpellier pour \u00e9couter le groupe NTM.", "id": 2, "time": "100"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : J'aime bien ce groupe. O\u00f9 se trouve la plage du Temps ? Combien \u00e7a co\u00fbte ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : C'est \u00e0 15 kilom\u00e8tres de la gare de Montpellier. C'est gratuit.  Est-ce que je peux utiliser ta voiture ?", "id": 3, "time": "8000"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Est-ce que tu sais conduire ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Bien s\u00fbr.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Humm. Est-ce que je peux venir avec Charlotte ? Je peux conduire.", "id": 4, "time": "19000"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> :\u00a0On se fait un resto apr\u00e8s le concert.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : \u00c7a marche.", "id": 5, "time": "27000"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Conversation 2 </span>", "id": 6, "time": "31000"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :  Salut Coraline. Nous arrivons chez toi dans quelques minutes. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> :  Nous ?", "id": 7, "time": "31000"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Jean et Charlotte sont avec moi.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : Parfait ! Charlotte et moi allons faire la causette en chemin, alors.", "id": 8, "time": "37500"}, {"image": "frn2le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Vous parlez souvent ensemble !<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Coraline</span> : Pas si souvent ! O\u00f9 \u00eates-vous maintenant ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :  Nous sommes dans ta rue.<br />", "id": 9, "time": "45000"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "", "coverimg": "", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "Conversation 1", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: \u00a0Hi Vanessa. We're driving to your place now.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \u00a0We?", "id": 1, "time": "10"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: \u00a0John and Sally are coming today as well.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \u00a0That's great! Sally and I can talk on the way.", "id": 2, "time": "300"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: You two talk all the time!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \u00a0Not that often! Where are you now?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: \u00a0We're on your street.", "id": 3, "time": "8500"}]}}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Je peux dire et demander aux gens ce qu'ils font et o\u00f9 ils vont.", "type": "Learning Outcome